line057","quote":"初，暨艷造營府之論，遜諫戒之，以為必禍。又謂諸葛恪曰：「在我前者，吾必奉之同升；在我下者，則扶持之。今觀君氣陵其上，意蔑乎下。非安德之基也。」又廣陵楊竺少獲聲名，而遜謂之終敗。勸竺兄穆令與別族。其先睹如此。長子延早夭，次子抗襲爵。孫休時，追謚遜曰昭侯。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line057:m0075","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-058-luxun:line057:m0091"}],"interpretation_note":"以此來源所述兩端為據。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-wucan:line089","text":"還，遷會稽太守，召處士謝譚為功曹，譚以疾不詣，粲教曰：\"夫應龍以屈伸為神，鳳皇以嘉鳴為貴，何必陷形於天外，潛鱗於重淵者哉？\"粲募合人眾，拜昭義中郎將，與呂岱討平山越，入為屯騎校尉、少府，遷太子太傅。遭二宮之變，抗言執正，明嫡庶之分，欲使魯王霸出駐夏口，遣楊竺不得令在都邑。又數以消息語陸遜，遜時駐武昌，連表諫爭。由此為霸、竺等所譖害，下獄誅。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-wucan:line089:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"譚","kind":"person","person_id":"1m3_1o3_4xn","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-wucan:line089:m0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"譚","kind":"person","person_id":"1m3_1o3_4xn","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-wucan:line089:m0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"粲","kind":"person","person_id":"pax_gtm_aew","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-wucan:line089:m0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"粲","kind":"person","person_id":"pax_gtm_aew","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-wucan:line089:m0076","start":76,"end":78,"surface":"呂岱","kind":"person","person_id":"2oe_qam_pq4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-wucan:line089:m0118","start":118,"end":121,"surface":"魯王霸","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba_B","status":"contextua